{"id":"n74454-2-10","stage":5,"title":"전래 · 传入","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74454-2-10-1","ko":"고추의 전래에 대해서 알고 있어?","zh":"你了解辣椒传入韩国的经过吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고추의","meaning":"辣椒","explanation":"고추：辣椒；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"고추","audio":"/audio/ffc402fc1aeb91aaed21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18366","senseId":"1","lemma":"고추","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고추의","audio":"/audio/a32f1f26675e34ce7507.mp3"}},{"text":"전래에","meaning":"传入","explanation":"전래：传入；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전래","audio":"/audio/86bf6c8c665188048f10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74454","senseId":"2","lemma":"전래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전래에","audio":"/audio/97e565cb3ff52e0d6e5f.mp3"}},{"text":"대해서","meaning":"对，对于","explanation":"대하다：对，对于；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"대하다","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86300","senseId":"3","lemma":"대하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대해서","audio":"/audio/62dfe178af4e3d52f287.mp3"}},{"text":"알고","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알고","audio":"/audio/8cb0c0a5afacb043256e.mp3"}},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ffc402fc1aeb91aa","term":"고추","zh":"辣椒","audio":"/audio/ffc402fc1aeb91aaed21.mp3","entryId":"18366","definition":"一种有辣